{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Sets the SECURITY groups on a library, control, or command — a deliberate permission act, distinct from tags (categorization). Empty ctl targets the library's meta.json; empty cmd targets the control record plus its inline data records; else the command's meta and impl records. Writes the comma-delimited groups string AND derives the enforced readers arrays from it (split on comma, trimmed) — the enforcement check_security/check_auth actually read. Explicit replace; empty string clears groups and derives [] (= admin-only). Library-level readers take effect on restart (system.libraries snapshot). writers is never modified. Returns changed, groups, and the derived readers.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"name":"groups","type":"String"},{"name":"author","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"ywwgiq19fb84a4e57h3","readers":[],"time":1786308405046,"username":"system","writers":[]}